OL,3,GNEWSATown's rail link plans move a step
OL,4,Acloser
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to restore passenger rail
OL,7,Fservices to a Lancashire town have
OL,8,Fmoved a step closer after an MP said he
OL,9,Fhad been assured the scheme would be
OL,10,Fincluded in the final version of the
OL,11,Fcounty's transport implementation plan.
OL,13,FCampaigners have long called for the
OL,14,Freturn of passenger trains to the
OL,15,FRawtenstall, which has been without a
OL,16,Frail service since its station closed
OL,17,Fin 1972.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
