OL,3,GNEWSATown's rail link plans move a step
OL,4,Acloser
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed City Valley Rail Link
OL,7,Fwould use the existing East Lancashire
OL,8,FRailway route between Rawtenstall and
OL,9,FBury, with passengers connecting to
OL,10,FMetrolink services into Manchester.
OL,12,FA future phase could see trains run
OL,13,Fdirectly to Manchester Victoria.
